# The browser engine's build output, which tools/build-wasm.sh writes. It stays out of the tree:
# what gets published is the built demo in docs/demo/, and committing this as well would carry the
# same nineteen megabytes twice. A checkout runs tools/build-wasm.sh to develop against it.
